### Service API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Get All Services
GET {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Create Service
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Service",
  "description": "Test service for API testing"
}

### 3. Create Service (Minimal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Minimal Service"
}

### 4. Create Service (Duplicate Name - Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Service",
  "description": "Duplicate service"
}

### 5. Create Service (Missing Name - Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing name"
}

### 6. Create Service (Empty Name - Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Empty name"
}

### 7. Get Service by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get Non-existent Service (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Update Service (Full Update)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/services/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Test Service",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### 10. Update Service (Partial Update - Name Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/services/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Partially Updated Service"
}

### 11. Update Service (Partial Update - Description Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/services/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Only description updated"
}

### 12. Update Service (Empty Body - Should Return Current Service)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/services/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 13. Update Service (Empty Name - Should Fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/services/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### 14. Update Non-existent Service (Should Fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/services/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Name"
}

### 15. Find Services by Exact Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/find?name=Test Service
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Find Services by Exact Name (Case Insensitive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/find?name=test service
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Find Services (Missing Name Parameter - Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/find
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Find Services (Empty Name Parameter - Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/find?name=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Find Non-existent Service
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/find?name=NonExistentService
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Delete Service
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/services/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Delete Non-existent Service (Should Fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/services/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 22. Delete Service in Use (Should Fail - if service is referenced by servers)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/services/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. Test Authentication (No Token - Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services

### 24. Test Authentication (Invalid Token - Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token

### 25. Test Content Type (Wrong Content Type - Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: text/plain

{
  "name": "Wrong Content Type"
}

### 26. Test Large Description
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Service with Large Description",
  "description": "This is a very long description that tests the system's ability to handle large text fields. It contains multiple sentences and should be properly stored and retrieved without any issues. The description field should support long text content and maintain proper formatting when displayed. This service provides various functionalities and can be used in different environments."
}

### 27. Test Special Characters in Name
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Service with Special Chars: @#$%^&*()",
  "description": "Testing special characters in service name"
}

### 28. Test Unicode Characters
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Service with Unicode: 测试服务",
  "description": "Testing Unicode characters in service name and description"
}

### 29. Test Whitespace Handling
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "  Service with Whitespace  ",
  "description": "  Description with whitespace  "
}

### 30. Test Null Values
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Service with Null Description",
  "description": null
}